      "@id": "urn:dregg:assortia:Q-PARTICIPANT-HOSTING",
      "@type": "Question",
      "label": "What establishes that a participant node may host and serve a particular resource?",
      "description": "The located client path decodes a SignedTurn, calls shared admission staging and dispatches toward consensus; cell readback exposes ledger state and a persistent receipt-chain head. Investigate placement, custody, discovery and availability obligations independently of client submission and validator membership.",
